      "statement": "The workspace enforces Test-Driven Development (TDD) with a strict red-green-refactor cycle: write a failing test first (RED), watch it fail for the right reason, write minimal code to pass (GREEN), verify full suite passes, then refactor as a separate step (REFACTOR).",
