      "id": "claim_2467739c5be74373891dba069f1b19cb",
      "statement": "Coverage practices: after structural refactors always re-run coverage; if branch coverage is below threshold, add focused tests for uncovered guard/fallback branches first; use hotspot-first loop (generate coverage, sort lowest branch-coverage files, patch highest-impact offenders, re-run); raise coverage with behavior-first assertions not synthetic inflation; keep Vitest configs thin inheriting from configuration/vitest.config.ts via mergeConfig; run CI-shaped command locally before PR: nx affected --target=vitest --configuration=coverage --base=main.",
